# Web colours

Use these colours on web pages and Home Assistant dashboards. Use a functional colour for its job first, such as the brand, link or error colour. Use the rest of the palette only for supporting elements, such as illustrations or custom cards.

<%= colour_copy_status %>

## Web palette

Use these colours for supporting elements, such as an illustration or a custom card. In a Home Assistant theme or custom card, use a civica theme variable, such as `civica-border-quiet`, instead of typing a value.

Most colours have tints at 25%, 50%, 80% and 95%, and shades at 25% and 50%. Black has tints for greys. White has no variants.

